=== property read only (1)
' Property mit nur GET -> Setter-Aufruf wirft.
CLASS Const42
    PROPERTY GET answer() AS INTEGER
        RETURN 42
    END PROPERTY
END CLASS

DIM c AS Const42
c = NEW Const42()
PRINT c.answer
c.answer = 99
--- fehler
Property 'answer' in const42 hat keinen Setter (read-only)

