=== property computed (1)
' Property kann berechnet sein -- kein einzelnes Backing-Field.
CLASS Point
    DIM x AS FLOAT
    DIM y AS FLOAT

    PROPERTY GET length() AS FLOAT
        RETURN SQR(Self.x * Self.x + Self.y * Self.y)
    END PROPERTY
END CLASS

DIM p AS Point
p = NEW Point()
p.x = 3.0
p.y = 4.0
PRINT p.length
--- erwartet
5.0

=== property computed (2)
